    "directions": [
      "Chop and Combine 1/4 Lettuce, 1 tomato, 1/4  redpepper, 1/4 Green pepper, 1/2 cucumber 1 avacado in a bowl and mix together. Then place In fridge.",
      "On a frying pan on high heat use 1 tbsp. Cocunut oil sortay 1/2 chopped onion, 3 cloves of garlic 1 chopped spring onion 1tsp scotch bonnet pepper for 3 mins",
      "Then drain the tinned ackee and carefully pour into frying pan and let it sit.",
      "Add 1 tsp sea salt, 1tsp black pepper, 1tsp thyme and carefully fold over the ackee and simmer for 5 mins.",
      "Combine ackee with salad squeeze lemon juice and serve."
    ],
